#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:107
#: d0b5d9db967b44baa82f493164ff4534
msgid "生效条件：`原子对来源`（`pair_source`）选择手动索引时。"
msgstr "Active when `Pair source` (`pair_source`) uses manual indices."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:103
#: 1ceeeba572274a75b5dad8dca550ddfa
msgid "右侧原子对索引（pair_right_indices）"
msgstr "pair_right_indices"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:105
#: 8d492ebe882f4183a51d80ece5c0fd0f
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。手动模式时，右侧原子 1-based 索引列表，与左侧一一配对。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. In manual mode, one-based indices for the right atoms, paired "
"position by position with the left list."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:109
#: 73641976e183406eb85d594365e41ed5
msgid "原子对来源（pair_source）"
msgstr "Atom-Pair Source (pair_source)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:111
#: 271d3d78071a4224b36577aeb3ae7ced
msgid "`str`，默认 `'Manual indices'`。手动索引适合可控验证；自动近邻壳层适合批量生成 DMI/交换路径样本，但需要检查元素对和键方向筛选。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Manual indices'`. Manual indices give controlled, auditable pairs. "
"Automatic neighbor shells generate DMI or exchange-path samples in bulk, but their "
"element and bond-direction filters must be checked."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:113
#: 858e76e98b5f4fd19216b3c298f702f1
msgid "近邻壳层（pair_shell）"
msgstr "Neighbor Shell (pair_shell)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:115
#: c606f1ed8279451dbc8b7fbf738ff651
msgid "`int`，默认 `1`。自动模式时取第几近邻壳层。1 为第一近邻，2 为第二近邻。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default: `1`. Neighbor shell in automatic mode: 1 for first neighbors, 2 for "
"second neighbors."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:117
#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:123
#: 0cb09dee589e421889e4efba32de3739
msgid "生效条件：`原子对来源`（`pair_source`）选择近邻自动搜索时。"
msgstr "Active when `Pair source` (`pair_source`) uses automatic neighbor search."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:119
#: d9bd52e60e904f01bf19e1b38fc38cb1
msgid "近邻壳层容差（pair_shell_tolerance）"
msgstr "pair_shell_tolerance"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:121
#: d643faf58ccb440b814e09cd88afc9fe
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.05`。自动分壳层的距离容差，单位 Å。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `0.05`. Distance tolerance in Å used to cluster automatically "
"detected neighbor shells."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:125
#: 36f855161e024c07b10ffa43e44e1ea0
msgid "原子对元素筛选（pair_element_filter）"
msgstr "pair_element_filter"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:127
#: 2b1b5a2f1d844ec99e52de5dbadf3d44
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。按元素对限制自动近邻 pair，例如 `Fe-Fe` 或 `Fe-Co`。DMI/交换路径分析时务必匹配目标相互作用元素对。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Element-pair filter for automatic neighbors, such as `Fe-Fe` or"
" `Fe-Co`. Match it to the interaction channel being studied."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:129
#: 25a0b9df7da9447aaa8abf78625ef1bc
msgid "生效条件：自动生成原子对后需要按元素筛选时。"
msgstr "Use when automatically generated pairs must be filtered by element."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:131
#: d3bc793edfd64ebea729170dd653b9be
msgid "原子对分组筛选（pair_group_filter）"
msgstr "pair_group_filter"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:133
#: d87b642c715c4f1bbe1b82295171cd5d
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。按 group 对限制自动近邻 pair，适合层状 AFM、界面或已标记子晶格。没有上游 group 标签时不要使用。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Group-pair filter for automatic neighbors, useful for layered "
"AFM states, interfaces, or labeled sublattices. Do not use it without upstream "
"`group` labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:135
#: cc0367d53b48414ba472eef443f07437
msgid "生效条件：自动生成原子对后需要按 group 筛选时。"
msgstr "Use when automatically generated pairs must be filtered by group."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:137
#: a02215c880444186a3da20d899f511fa
msgid "键筛选方式（bond_filter_mode）"
msgstr "bond_filter_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:139
#: bbc8c8daa267419e80938f180303abef
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Any'`。`Any` 保留所有候选键；`Near axis` 选接近某方向的键；`Near plane` "
"选接近某晶面的键，用于区分面内/面外相互作用。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Any'`. `Any` retains all candidate bonds. `Near axis` selects bonds"
" close to a direction; `Near plane` selects bonds close to a plane, enabling in-plane"
" and out-of-plane interaction channels to be separated."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:141
#: 0cb43a0e75c6470683dcb493ff517555
msgid "键筛选轴（bond_filter_axis）"
msgstr "bond_filter_axis"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:143
#: cd994b31ae6c4a6d8d22b8b624376c1e
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`。研究面内/面外 DMI "
"时必须和晶体取向一致。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. Reference "
"axis or plane normal for bond filtering. It must match the actual crystal orientation"
" in an in-plane/out-of-plane DMI study."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:145
#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:151
#: e326fadaa68441598f12f91e15dda8a3
msgid "生效条件：`键筛选方式`（`bond_filter_mode`）不是关闭状态时。"
msgstr "Active when `Bond filter mode` (`bond_filter_mode`) is not disabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:147
#: d2c7b04d1d8840b6a79ada38ddf48849
msgid "键筛选容差（bond_filter_tolerance）"
msgstr "bond_filter_tolerance"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:149
#: ab107b07631a4ec696673795f6fdfdab
msgid "`float`，默认 `20.0`。方向筛选容差——设太小可能找不到 pair，设太大会混入不该比较的交换路径。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default: `20.0`. Angular tolerance for bond-direction filtering. Too small "
"may select no pairs; too large may mix distinct exchange paths."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:153
#: 000f2515f2954481af3c0166e1fc38c7
msgid "Group Pair 模式"
msgstr "Group-pair mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:155
#: 6ec06e488f0c44d7bb7f9eb329842ddc
msgid "A 组（group_a）"
msgstr "group_a"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:157
#: 516d8ccb70aa45bba53314d363a684a5
msgid "`str`，默认 `'A'`。`arrays['group']` 中的标签名。需要输入已有 group 标签。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'A'`. Label in `arrays['group']` for the first group. The input must"
" already contain group labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:159
#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:165
#: 862d108b1b9d4df4a827e6190db36d94
msgid "生效条件：需要 group pair、手动 group 或 AFM group 模式时。"
msgstr "Used by group-pair, manual-group, or AFM-group modes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:161
#: 5611263250ca49d9a9738c63f31e2ac9
msgid "B 组（group_b）"
msgstr "group_b"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:163
#: d5f4b8a8e9f2459885f8b2baa9f1e122
msgid "`str`，默认 `'B'`。`arrays['group']` 中的标签名。需要输入已有 group 标签。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'B'`. Label in `arrays['group']` for the second group. The input "
"must already contain group labels."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:167
#: b05bd1c5d34a498683ef1d8f9760f350
msgid "角度和手性"
msgstr "Angles and chirality"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:169
#: 5dc76acb961748c78ba6993239423473
msgid "倾斜角列表（angle_list）"
msgstr "angle_list"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:171
#: a30b7a02436d41a0b245eecbbde08459
msgid "`str`，默认 `'1,2,5,10'`。逗号分隔的偏转角列表，单位度。推荐从这个默认列表起步。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'1,2,5,10'`. Comma-separated tilt angles in degrees. The default is "
"a practical small-angle starting set."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:173
#: 85d94e791bfe4962845a5ddd133eb6ea
msgid "倾斜符号（tilt_signs）"
msgstr "tilt_signs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:175
#: 8eafed1a5cc04897b9150f1fa126cc5e
msgid "`str`，默认 `'Positive only'`。只做 +θ 可以验证局部响应；同时做 ±θ 才能提取手性不对称项，DMI 数据建议用成对输出。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `'Positive only'`. A `+θ` sample is enough for a local-response "
"check. Matched `±θ` samples are required to isolate chirality-odd contributions and "
"are recommended for DMI data."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:177
#: decdd84e9cf04994be57c40dc4f8b6a1
msgid "包含参考构型（include_reference）"
msgstr "include_reference"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:179
#: 31f091d821494a5baece3c978499b5ca
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 `True`。额外输出一帧未偏转的参考磁态，方便做 energy difference 对比。打开后 "
"`最大输出数`（`max_outputs`）至少为 2，确保预算中还留有一帧真正的 canting 输出。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `True`. Also output one untilted reference magnetic state for energy-difference "
"comparisons. When enabled, set `max_outputs` to at least 2 so the budget still includes one actual canting output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:181
#: d1af529717894829b88fb226ffcd973e
msgid "磁矩与参考态"
msgstr "Moments and reference state"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:183
#: 59d9e08248734c14bf5926c368c95195
msgid "磁矩大小来源（magnitude_source）"
msgstr "magnitude_source"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:185
#: 8c169c3754444ac8931325f64af2fe2b
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `'Existing initial magmoms'`。已有 `initial_magmoms` 时复用它最安全；没有磁矩输入时用 "
"`元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）/`默认磁矩`（`default_moment`）构造幅值。不要用默认幅值替代已知元素磁矩。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `'Existing initial magmoms'`. Reusing existing `initial_magmoms` is safest when available. "
"When the input has no moments, construct magnitudes from `magmom_map` and `default_moment`. Do not replace known element moments with a generic default."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:187
#: fc3f6da380fa43e5b53d365f1135c037
msgid "元素磁矩表（magmom_map）"
msgstr "magmom_map"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:189
#: c57780cc0acc4b9880fe16c89a8bc290
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。已知元素局域磁矩时显式写入，如 `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`。未知元素不要用默认值伪造先验。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `''`. Provide known element-resolved local moments explicitly, for "
"example `Fe:2.2,Ni:0.6`. Do not invent a prior for an unknown element through a "
"default value."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:191
#: 253f5fa79b0b45a4b27540ea12e70101
msgid "默认磁矩（default_moment）"
msgstr "default_moment"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:193
#: 88e14dea1e4a489ba79f2e8b3230c6a0
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.0`。只作为 `元素磁矩表`（`magmom_map`）未命中元素的兜底幅值。关键磁性元素应显式列出，非磁元素通常保持 0。"
msgstr "`float`, default `0.0`. Used only as a fallback magnitude for elements absent from `magmom_map`. List important magnetic elements explicitly; nonmagnetic elements should normally remain 0."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:195
#: 09b20bf6b7e241c4890edbdf73248181
msgid "标量磁矩转为矢量（lift_scalar）"
msgstr "lift_scalar"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:197
#: ab9f9d4d4edc464f9e8796d7afec58cb
msgid "`bool`，默认 `True`。输入是标量磁矩但下游需要非共线向量时打开；如果原始数据已有方向信息，不要重新提升覆盖它。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `True`. Enable when scalar moments must be promoted to noncollinear "
"vectors. Do not promote again when the input already contains directional "
"information."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:199
#: 9a546354f39a4aaf825a3b784aabe36f
msgid "轴（axis）"
msgstr "axis"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:201
#: 50d8358d3dd3458198cb66835e387a04
msgid ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0, "
"1.0)`。这是方向参考，不是普通数值——改它会改变分层、表面法向或磁矩方向。使用前先确认 cell 取向和目标物理方向。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default `(0.0, 0.0, 1.0)`. This is a "
"directional reference, not an ordinary scalar setting: changing it changes a layering"
" direction, surface normal, or moment direction. Confirm the cell orientation and "
"intended physical direction first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:203
#: f72dcb6c701e45f7be5130ccded73623
msgid "生效条件：涉及方向、分层、表面或向量初始化的模式都会使用。"
msgstr ""
"Used by modes that depend on a direction, layering, a surface, or vector "
"initialization."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:205
#: 8b24afe468f847c0abc03e1321e29c37
msgid "参考方向（reference_direction）"
msgstr "reference_direction"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:207
#: fb9dbef451f24a2ab93ad80f24d4a0d8
msgid "`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`，默认 `(1.0, 0.0, 0.0)`。canting 平面的首选侧向参考方向。"
msgstr ""
"`list[float] | tuple[float, float, float]`, default: `(1.0, 0.0, 0.0)`. Preferred "
"transverse reference direction used to define the canting plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:209
#: 9d58d1e0456e425b8231ec7d5e5354f3
msgid "应用元素（apply_elements）"
msgstr "apply_elements"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:211
#: a27569582bde4e38b90af0f54598d8a9
msgid "`str`，默认 `''`。限制哪些元素参与目标筛选，留空则全部参与。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default: `''`. Restricts target selection to specified elements. Leave empty "
"to include all."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:213
#: 32eee7574f9748058b5f4371cc5e8de4
msgid "输出预算"
msgstr "Output Budget"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:215
#: 783edcb63fd948258a89d47d8f1db074
msgid "最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:217
#: 25f06ef37de647a786d385a30d5fd29f
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 `100`。自动 pair、角度列表和正负手性会相乘放大输出数量。这个上限包含 reference；开启 "
"`包含参考构型`（`include_reference`）时至少设为 2。先用 20-100 检查 pair 选择是否合理，确认后再扩大到完整 DMI 扫描。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `100`. Automatic pairs, the angle list, and both chiralities multiply the output count. "
"The limit includes the reference; when `include_reference` is enabled, set it to at least 2. Start with 20–100 outputs to verify pair selection, then expand to the full DMI scan."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:219
#: ba159b3fb3e1444fa603bd1b85da447a
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:221
#: 23c8e192e2ba472d8e7962c791d72a65
msgid "单自旋验证（~5 个输出，先确认流程正确）"
msgstr "Single-spin check (~5 outputs; validate the convention first)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:222
#: c5d73e362885419387c2134b58585abf
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"SmallAngleSpinTiltCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"canting_mode\": \"Single-spin tilt\",\n"
"  \"target_mode\": \"First eligible atom\",\n"
"  \"target_indices\": \"\",\n"
"  \"pair_left_indices\": \"\",\n"
"  \"pair_right_indices\": \"\",\n"
"  \"pair_source\": \"Manual indices\",\n"
"  \"pair_shell\": [1],\n"
