#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:348
#: 8449f1c3fc1343bab09ef48fa0110c7b
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/small-angle-spin-tilt-card.md:350
#: c4a1874f3a6748b69e3f0bdbf8283d37
msgid "无随机性。相同输入、相同参数 → 严格一致输出。`参考方向`（`reference_direction`）会先对基准磁矩方向正交化，结果是确定性的。"
msgstr "There is no randomness. Identical input and parameters produce identical output. `reference_direction` is first orthogonalized against the baseline moment direction, so the result is deterministic."

#~ msgid "**关键限制：** 这是一张确定性卡片——没有随机采样。每个角度和每个目标都会生成确定性的输出。需要随机方向扰动时用 `Magmom Rotation`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Important limitation:** This card is "
#~ "deterministic. Every selected target and angle "
#~ "produces a fixed output. Use `Magmom Rotation`"
#~ " for random directional perturbations."

